    <string name="intro_title">Use both at once</string>
    <string name="intro_body">Each new connection goes out over Wi-Fi or mobile data, balanced by how fast each one is. Downloads and pages that open many connections get faster; a single connection stays on one network. Mobile data stays on while this is active, so keep an eye on your data plan.</string>
