    <string name="add_another">To add another computer, open Peyvand\'s menu on it: Phones › Pair with this phone.</string>
    <string name="boost_data_note">Your computer\'s downloads use this phone\'s mobile data while the booster is on. Your computer keeps its own Wi-Fi too: Peyvand on the computer adds the two together.</string>
