    <string name="howto_title">Connect your computer in four steps</string>
    <string name="howto_1">Install Peyvand on the Windows computer and connect it to the same Wi-Fi as this phone.</string>
    <string name="howto_2">Turn on the booster here (the button above) and keep mobile data on.</string>
    <string name="howto_3">On the computer, click the Peyvand icon next to the clock: Phones › your phone › Pair with this phone.</string>
    <string name="howto_4">Check that both screens show the same six digits and tap Approve here.</string>

