    <string name="about_body">Peyvand merges your connections: Wi-Fi and mobile data on this phone, and this phone\'s mobile data with your computer\'s Wi-Fi. Based on net-merge by Rohit Mahto and its Android port (MIT). Font: Vazirmatn (SIL OFL).</string>

